#*: O my [[love|Luve]]'s like a red, red '''rose'''<br>That's newly sprung in [[June|june]]...
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1913|author=w:Gertrude Stein|title=Sacred Emily
|passage=[[:w:Rose is a rose is a rose is a rose|Rose is a '''rose''' is a '''rose''' is a '''rose'''.]]}}
# A plant or species in the rose family. ({{taxfmt|Rosaceae|family}})
